{% import "partials/copy-command.njk" as cmd %}

<h1>Adding endpoints</h1>
<p>Register endpoints so the controller can distribute test packages and execute steps on them.</p>

<h2 id="install-endpoints">Install the endpoints</h2>
<p>If an endpoint machine is connected to the internet, install it the same way as the controller:</p>
{{ cmd.copyCommand("pip install orcraft") }}
<p>If it is not connected, download the wheel file instead and install it directly:</p>
{{ cmd.copyCommand("pip install orcraft-<version>-py3-none-any.whl") }}

<h2 id="run-endpoints">Run the endpoints</h2>
<p>For a fast setup on a trusted local network, endpoints can be run without security enabled:</p>
{{ cmd.copyCommand("orcraft-endpoint run -secure disabled") }}
<p>For a secure deployment, follow the security setup procedure in the controller before running
  the endpoint with authentication enabled, which is the default:</p>
{{ cmd.copyCommand("orcraft-endpoint run") }}
